  "gh:content": {
    "en": "Waterways, power, communications—anomalous waveforms with the same correlation. A nameless force grips the city’s throat. I ask for a “name.” Calling is the first procedure to bring a target back into the world. I steady my breath to avoid choosing fear.",
    "ja": "水路・電力・通信——同じ相関の異様な波形。名のない力が都市の喉元を掴む。私は\"名\"を問う。呼びかけは、対象を世界に引き戻す最初の手続き。恐れに依らないよう、呼吸を整える。"
  },
  "gh:index": 2
}